# QUESTION  : STATELESS AUTHENTICATION KYA HAI?
==================================================

External Session Store (Redis) distributed environment me HttpSession manage karne ki problem solve karta hai.
Lekin Redis use karne ke baad bhi application ko user ki session state server-side maintain karni pad rahi hai.

Stateless Authentication me server ko user ka authentication aur authorization context server-side state me maintain
karna mandatory nahi hota. Is purpose ke liye commonly JWT (JSON Web Token) use kiya jata hai.


------------------------------
## QUESTION : JWT KYA HAI ?
------------------------------

JWT ek token format hai jo Authentication aur
Authorization-related claims ko transmit karne ke
liye commonly use kiya jata hai.

JWT self-contained hota hai — yaani authentication/authorization
ke liye required information token ke andar hi hoti hai,
isliye server ko session maintain karne ki zarurat nahi padti.

Successful login ke baad server user ko ek JWT issue karta hai. Har subsequent request ke saath
client JWT bhejta hai, aur application JWT verify karke uske claims ke basis par Authentication / Authorization 
perform karti hai — requested resource/API access dene se pehle.

Spring Boot applications me Spring Security JWT-based Authentication/Authorization
implement karne me help karta hai.



-----------------------------------------------------------------------
## QUESTION : KYA JWT ME ARBITRARY INFORMATION STORE KI JA SAKTI HAI?
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

Technically JWT claims me arbitrary information rakhi ja sakti hai,
lekin generally unnecessary ya sensitive information JWT me
store nahi karni chahiye, kyunki JWT payload encrypted nahi hota
by default.

JWT ka payload Base64URL encoded hota hai, encrypted nahi.
Isliye payload ko decode karke uske contents easily read kiye ja sakte hain.

Examples of information that should generally NOT be stored:

    - Passwords
    - Credit Card Numbers
    - OTPs
    - Highly Sensitive Personal Data
    - Secrets



