            request.getUsername(),
            request.getPassword()
        )
    );



STEP 5: AUTHENTICATIONPROVIDER UserDetailsService SE UserDetails LOAD KARTA HAI
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`AuthenticationProvider` ko user ki details chahiye hoti hain.

Username/password based authentication me `DaoAuthenticationProvider` commonly
`UserDetailsService' ka use karta hai.

UserDetailsService ka kaam hai: username ke basis par database se user details fetch karna aur 
unhe UserDetails object ke form me represent karna. Technically UserDetailsService ek interface hai, 
aur uska implementation (custom class) ye kaam karta hai. 

Conceptually:

    UserDetails
       |
       ├── username
       ├── password (stored hash)
